From ecc416b163406ecf06816e52588b47a9a34ba28e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "suricata.lu" <suricata.lu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 03:41:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm/imx: pass reset_control_flags to
 of_reset_control_array_get()

CIP backported "reset: replace boolean parameters with flags parameter"
(v6.12.51-cip10, patch 0255), which changed of_reset_control_array_get()
to take an enum reset_control_flags instead of the shared, optional and
acquired booleans. The NXP-only LCDIF and MIPI DSIM drivers still pass
(false, false, true) and fail to build.

Pass RESET_CONTROL_EXCLUSIVE, which is the same request, as NXP does in
lf-6.18.y (f3104188306f "drm/imx: Replace reset flow for LCDIF" and
33c4f9c0aefe "drm/imx: Replace reset flow for DSIM").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/imx/sec_mipi_dsim-imx.c | 2 +-
 drivers/gpu/imx/lcdif/lcdif-common.c    | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/imx/sec_mipi_dsim-imx.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/imx/sec_mipi_dsim-imx.c
index 0aea8beb8fe2..9626c9e893b6 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/imx/sec_mipi_dsim-imx.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/imx/sec_mipi_dsim-imx.c
@@ -334,7 +334,7 @@ static int sec_dsim_of_parse_resets(struct imx_sec_dsim_device *dsim)
 		if (!compat)
 			continue;
 
-		rstc = of_reset_control_array_get(child, false, false, true);
+		rstc = of_reset_control_array_get(child, RESET_CONTROL_EXCLUSIVE);
 		if (IS_ERR(rstc))
 			continue;
 
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/imx/lcdif/lcdif-common.c b/drivers/gpu/imx/lcdif/lcdif-common.c
index 5e7955057077..aca8eb2ac225 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/imx/lcdif/lcdif-common.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/imx/lcdif/lcdif-common.c
@@ -680,7 +680,7 @@ static int lcdif_of_parse_resets(struct lcdif_soc *lcdif)
 		if (!compat)
 			continue;
 
-		rstc = of_reset_control_array_get(child, false, false, true);
+		rstc = of_reset_control_array_get(child, RESET_CONTROL_EXCLUSIVE);
 		if (IS_ERR(rstc))
 			continue;
 
